# Agents skills runtime link

`~/.agents/skills` is a folder of **per-skill** junctions into this repo's `skills/<name>/`. Relink only with:

```powershell
pwsh -File scripts/setup-windows-agents-link.ps1
```

That script reads [`.agents-runtime-exclude`](../../.agents-runtime-exclude) and links every other skill that has a `SKILL.md`. A non-reparse parent folder is the expected shape — the junctions are the children. After an upstream sync that adds skills, re-run the script.
